  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-03-05T04:08:33.774Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I'm not sure if this is already a thing and I may have missed it somewhere in the SDK or the docs. Rather than having to toggle visibility of gizmos for each component individually, it would be helpful to have a secondary option to toggle their visibility for the entire scene, if possible. This would allow for the creator to see an overall picture much easier than going through and toggling gizmos off and on individually.",
